        <h4>Announcements</h4>
        <p>AlterForm is a free and open source furry art gallery web app.
            We're all tired of new furry "platforms" that all suck at moderation.
            AlterForm leaves moderation and hosting up to the community and provides a solid foundation
            in the form of a well-documented containerized webapp that can be deployed with a single "docker compose up -d" command.
            And no. I did not use AI in this project at all. I typed every line by hoof.
        </p>
